{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/extras/7e28fd09d651954561e108d502f8a708.poster.avif?t=1759777916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/extras/7e28fd09d651954561e108d502f8a708.webm?t=1759777916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicarius is a small handcrafted open world focused on exploration and combat. Leave your safe zone to gather the resources that will help you craft better gear. The further you go, the more dangerous it gets but the resources are also better. Dying means losing everything that you are carrying.     <br> <br>In this Action-Adventure game, you ascend into a world you know nothing about. You won't be handheld in any way. No tutorial. No direction. No map. No goal given. Minimal user interface. <strong>Figure it out or stay stuck</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>This game isn't for everyone</strong>. It doesn't try to be. It is difficult. And there is no option to make it easier. If you are looking for a game that will hold your hand all the way until the finish line then this game isn't for you. And it's okay. I'm sure you'll find something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features the first area of the game which introduces you to two weapons and two abilities. In this area, you'll encounter your first enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted open world with different biomes. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of enemies each with unique abilities. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the mechanics that will help you progress. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the resources you'll need to craft your gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your loadout by choosing between different weapons and abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get back alive to the safe zone to not lose your gear and loot. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exterminate what stands between you and the answers you are looking for.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIGURE IT OUT OR STAY STUCK.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE. UNDERSTAND. EXTERMINATE.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078940?t=1759777916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078940?t=1759777916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/ae5c238aa9c962b0fa4182ed84029e99dba9dc40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759777916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/ae5c238aa9c962b0fa4182ed84029e99dba9dc40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759777916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/extras/7e28fd09d651954561e108d502f8a708.poster.avif?t=1759777916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/extras/7e28fd09d651954561e108d502f8a708.webm?t=1759777916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicarius is a small handcrafted open world focused on exploration and combat. Leave your safe zone to gather the resources that will help you craft better gear. The further you go, the more dangerous it gets but the resources are also better. Dying means losing everything that you are carrying.     <br> <br>In this Action-Adventure game, you ascend into a world you know nothing about. You won't be handheld in any way. No tutorial. No direction. No map. No goal given. Minimal user interface. <strong>Figure it out or stay stuck</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>This game isn't for everyone</strong>. It doesn't try to be. It is difficult. And there is no option to make it easier. If you are looking for a game that will hold your hand all the way until the finish line then this game isn't for you. And it's okay. I'm sure you'll find something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features the first area of the game which introduces you to two weapons and two abilities. In this area, you'll encounter your first enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted open world with different biomes. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of enemies each with unique abilities. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the mechanics that will help you progress. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the resources you'll need to craft your gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your loadout by choosing between different weapons and abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get back alive to the safe zone to not lose your gear and loot. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exterminate what stands between you and the answers you are looking for.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIGURE IT OUT OR STAY STUCK.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE. UNDERSTAND. EXTERMINATE.</strong></p>","developers":["Nocten"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3894540","name":"Vicarius"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078940/81cfdbf022e36fd472b06adfc097f249231c20d1/header.jpg?t=1759777916","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078940/1456691739/5902c7afc3e41e7f1dee746b8040396d00da90a4/1759338906/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759493783","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078940/1456691739/5902c7afc3e41e7f1dee746b8040396d00da90a4/1759338906/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759493783","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078940/1456691739/5902c7afc3e41e7f1dee746b8040396d00da90a4/1759338906/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759493783","id":257210192,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210192/movie480.mp4?t=1759493783","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210192/movie_max.mp4?t=1759493783"},"name":"Vicarius - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210192/aa08762ac29d6ecfb47063b8fce594c808d191ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759493783","webm":{"480"